{"text":"MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The longer HDMI cable felt useful because it could help route a display connection around my desk, alongside my cable covers and ties.",
    "Recommending a connection accessory fits my recent interest in adapters and cables, although I would check whether my existing HDMI cable already reaches."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "The Fire TV devices do not help with the computer setup I am working on; exploring a Raspberry Pi does not mean I currently want another streaming device.",
    "The tablets, Echo Dot and smart plug introduce uses I have not expressed a need for, while the portable speaker does not follow the personal listening needs reflected in my headphones and under-desk mount.",
    "The Wi-Fi extender assumes a coverage problem I have not mentioned. My recent Ethernet adapter and cables make wired connection accessories more relevant right now."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "The suggestions treat interest in electronics as a reason to want many kinds of gadgets, even when they solve very different problems.",
    "My Kindle and Amazon Basics accessories seem to have been taken as interest in more Amazon devices, although their practical uses are what connect them to my needs."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My recent purchases cluster around connecting, organizing and maintaining computer equipment: Ethernet cables, a headphone mount and a blower duster all support that purpose.",
    "An accessory needs to add something useful to equipment I already have. Extra cable length could matter, but another tablet or streaming device needs a separate reason.",
    "The more recent wired networking and desk maintenance purchases say more about my immediate needs than my older Raspberry Pi and Kindle interactions."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The suggestions recognize my interest in electronics but mostly miss my current focus on practical computer connections, desk organization and maintenance."
}"}
